---
title: "emode configuration (Current Finance: E-Mode)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_new_group: new_emode_group(oracle_base_token)
    q_new_group --> q_assign_id: group_id = next_group_id++
    q_assign_id --> q_init_group: EModeGroup(assets, assets_borrows, oracle_base_token)
    q_init_group --> q_support: support_asset(group, CoinType, params)

    q_support --> q_check_group: assert group exists
    q_check_group --> q_check_dup: assert asset not already in group
    q_check_dup --> q_create_emode: EMode with dynamic fields
    q_create_emode --> q_add_collateral: add EModeCollateral(cf, lf, li)
    q_add_collateral --> q_add_borrow: add EModeBorrow(max_borrow, weight)
    q_add_borrow --> q_add_flash: add EModeFlashLoan(fee_rate)
    q_add_flash --> q_add_limiter: add EModeRateLimiter(deposit, borrow)
    q_add_limiter --> q_store: group.assets.store(emode)
    q_store --> q_init_borrows: assets_borrows[CoinType] = 0
    q_init_borrows --> [*]

    note right of q_create_emode
        INV-001: group_id is sequential, max u8::MAX groups
        INV-002: Each asset has separate emode config per group
        INV-003: collateral_factor determines borrowing power
        INV-004: liquidation_factor determines liquidation threshold
        INV-005: borrow_weight increases weighted debt for risk calculation
        INV-006: flash_loan_fee_rate is per-emode per-asset
        INV-007: assets_borrows tracks aggregate borrows per emode group per asset
    end note
